{"quest_id": 7012, "name": "消えた助手を探して", "description": "はぐれた助手を探すため、魔物に襲われた\n場所に戻ってきたニコルたち。痕跡を辿る\n邪魔をするゴブリンたちを蹴散らせ！\n中級（★１獲得の目安：平均Lv1 出撃8体）", "event": "アルケウス・アルケミスト", "event_category": "History", "mission_id": 920142, "map_no": 5721, "level": 100, "multiplier": 1.0, "charisma": 25, "exp": 200, "gold": 800, "drops": [{"item": 5002, "c": 1}, {"card": 73, "c": 2}, {"item": 2001, "c": 1}, {"card": 1654, "c": 1}], "capacity": 8, "enemies": [{"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 20, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 640, "attack": 140, "base_hp": 640, "base_attack": 140, "damage_type": "physical", "attack_speed": 40, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 101, "move_speed": 700.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.25, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2097200, "race_id": 9, "master_id": 3, "spawn_sec": 2}, {"enemy_id": 2, "source": "local", "count": 6, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 5000, "attack": 400, "base_hp": 5000, "base_attack": 400, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 50, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 156, "move_speed": 370.0, "gain_cost": 2, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2097792, "master_id": 9, "spawn_sec": 18}, {"enemy_id": 3, "source": "local", "count": 3, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 640, "base_hp": 640, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 40, "attack_speed": 65, "attack_wait": 10, "move_speed": 650.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.2999999523162842, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2097216, "master_id": 4, "spawn_sec": 43}, {"enemy_id": 4, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 3000, "attack": 250, "base_hp": 3000, "base_attack": 250, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 300, "attack_range": 160, "attack_speed": 90, "attack_wait": 30, "attack_interval": 101, "move_speed": 1800.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.25, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2098240, "race_id": 9, "special_effect_id": 496, "missile_id": 15, "missile": {"speed": 2.0, "deflectable": true}, "master_id": 32436, "global_id": 6055, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 52}, {"enemy_id": 5, "source": "local", "count": 12, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 640, "attack": 200, "base_hp": 640, "base_attack": 200, "damage_type": "physical", "attack_range": 140, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 60, "attack_interval": 171, "move_speed": 700.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.2999999523162842, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2098016, "race_id": 9, "missile_id": 9, "missile": {"speed": 3.0, "deflectable": true}, "master_id": 68, "global_id": 67, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 71}], "dialogue": [{"trigger": "start", "lines": [{"name": "コリン", "text": "――ここが、ゴブリンに\n襲撃された地点であっているかな？", "face": "u227"}, {"name": "ニコル", "text": "うんうん。抽出に成功した『賢者の金赤石』を、\n鉱脈から工房へ持ち帰る途中に襲われたんだよ。", "face": "u994"}, {"name": "レアン", "text": "確かに、戦闘の痕跡があるな……。\n助手はどうやら戦いの心得もあったようだ。", "face": "u50"}, {"name": "ニコル", "text": "そうそう！\n街で変なのに絡まれた時とか助けてくれたしね！\nすっごい頼れる助手ちゃんなんだよ～！", "face": "u994"}, {"name": "コリン", "text": "自分の身を守ることができるなら、\n無事に逃げ延びた可能性も高いな。\nひとまずこの周辺を捜索しようか。", "face": "u227"}, {"name": "フウカ", "text": "――いえ、ちょっと待って。\n誰かに監視されているわ。王子、気をつけて。", "face": "u228"}, {"name": "ゴブリン博士", "text": "（――我々の気配に気づくトハ、\nさすがは王国軍と言うべきカ……）", "face": "l134051adcf91"}, {"name": "ゴブリン博士", "text": "（ダガ！　鉱脈とは良いことを聞いタゾ！\n『賢者の金赤石』の量産も夢ではナイ！！）", "face": "l134051adcf91"}, {"name": "ゴブリン博士", "text": "（これより鉱脈の探索に移ル！\nお前達は王子の足止めをするのダ！！）", "face": "l134051adcf91"}, {"name": "ゴブリン", "text": "ギャギャ！！　アシドメ！　アシドメ！！", "face": "lb79bc397ddd1"}, {"name": "コリン", "text": "自ら足止めだと説明してくれるとは。\n王子、助手殿のことが心配だ。\n早々に蹴散らしてしまおう。", "face": "u227"}]}, {"trigger": "end", "lines": [{"name": "ニコル", "text": "すごい……さすがは王子さま！　さすがは王国軍～！\nゴブリンをあっさり蹴散らしちゃうなんて！", "face": "u994"}, {"name": "フウカ", "text": "とはいえ、欠片を持つ魔物は要注意ね。\nこれくらいなら、どうということはないけれど――", "face": "u228"}, {"name": "コリン", "text": "――全てのゴブリンが欠片を\n持ったらと思うと、少々頭が痛いな……。", "face": "u227"}, {"name": "レアン", "text": "そうならないために、私達が捜査をしているんだろう？\nだが、幸い助手殿はすぐに見つかりそうだ。\n戦闘の痕跡が向こうへ続いている。", "face": "u50"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "たどっていけば、合流できそうですね。\n王子、このまま追跡を続けましょう！", "face": "l395a4968e6f1"}]}], "map": {"image": "Map920142_5721", "w": 960, "h": 640, "spots": [{"k": "b", "x": 937, "y": 434}, {"k": "m", "x": 625, "y": 138, "id": 200}, {"k": "m", "x": 837, "y": 402, "id": 201}, {"k": "m", "x": 727, "y": 427, "id": 202}, {"k": "m", "x": 625, "y": 450, "id": 203}, {"k": "m", "x": 521, "y": 463, "id": 204}, {"k": "m", "x": 213, "y": 426, "id": 205}, {"k": "m", "x": 102, "y": 205, "id": 206}, {"k": "m", "x": 183, "y": 152, "id": 207}, {"k": "m", "x": 282, "y": 138, "id": 208}, {"k": "m", "x": 395, "y": 131, "id": 209}, {"k": "m", "x": 505, "y": 128, "id": 210}, {"k": "m", "x": 830, "y": 322, "id": 211}, {"k": "m", "x": 801, "y": 235, "id": 212}, {"k": "m", "x": 407, "y": 465, "id": 213}, {"k": "m", "x": 727, "y": 172, "id": 214}, {"k": "m", "x": 90, "y": 303, "id": 215}, {"k": "m", "x": 136, "y": 378, "id": 216}, {"k": "m", "x": 305, "y": 454, "id": 217}, {"k": "m", "x": 358, "y": 275, "id": 218}, {"k": "m", "x": 559, "y": 354, "id": 219}, {"k": "m", "x": 356, "y": 371, "id": 220}, {"k": "m", "x": 292, "y": 217, "id": 221}, {"k": "m", "x": 493, "y": 305, "id": 222}, {"k": "r", "x": 722, "y": 101, "id": 300}, {"k": "r", "x": 741, "y": 276, "id": 301}, {"k": "r", "x": 223, "y": 213, "id": 302}, {"k": "r", "x": 759, "y": 353, "id": 303}, {"k": "r", "x": 283, "y": 380, "id": 304}, {"k": "r", "x": 180, "y": 315, "id": 305}, {"k": "r", "x": 444, "y": 74, "id": 306}, {"k": "r", "x": 433, "y": 392, "id": 307}, {"k": "r", "x": 873, "y": 210, "id": 308}, {"k": "r", "x": 410, "y": 334, "id": 309}]}, "start_cost": 10, "active": true}